---
import TreatmentLayout from '../../components/TreatmentLayout.astro';
import PriceBlock from '../../components/PriceBlock.astro';
import { haircuts, signatureBlowDry } from '../../data/services';
import { images } from '../../data/images';
---

<TreatmentLayout
  title="Haircuts"
  metaTitle="Haircuts and Signature Blow-Dry"
  description="Haircuts at Maison Coiffure: €35 at every length, including consultation, wash and quick blow-dry. Teen haircuts €30. Signature Blow-Dry from €25."
  lede="Great hair is about the right shape, movement and attention to detail."
  image={images.haircutBob}
  waMessage="Hello Maison Coiffure, I would like to book a haircut."
>
  <p>
    Whether you love long layers, natural curls or a fresh new cut, every hairstyle is created to
    suit you, your hair and your personality. Every haircut includes a personal consultation, hair
    wash, haircut and quick blow-dry, and there is always enough time to do things properly.
  </p>
  <p>
    Curly hair asks for its own approach: curls are cut dry, following your natural pattern. You
    will find the dedicated curly haircut on the <a href="/treatments/curls">Curls page</a>.
  </p>
  <h2>Signature Blow-Dry</h2>
  <p>
    A Signature Blow-Dry is a bit more than just a blow-dry. It is a polished finish with extra
    attention to shape, movement, shine and lasting style. Perfect for dinner, drinks, a date or a
    day when you want your hair to look extra good.
  </p>

  <Fragment slot="after">
    <PriceBlock group={haircuts} headingLevel="h2" />
    <PriceBlock group={signatureBlowDry} headingLevel="h2" />
  </Fragment>
</TreatmentLayout>
